# PRD, Consciousness Stream & MCP

- **PRD:** Before major architecture/product decisions, read the requirements — `instructions.md` / `PRD.md` once one exists; until then, `AGENTS.md`, `README.md`, `CHANGELOG.md`.
- **`.notes/meeting_notes.md`:** Short, dated decisions (why/what/impact) for later sessions.
- **MCP:** Enable only with user approval (GitHub issues/PRs, docs search). Never commit tokens or repo URLs with embedded credentials into rules.
